{"id":"c183a7e6e81c5c97","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-zfc-topo11-connected-subspace.md","title":"ZFC Topo11 Connected Subspace","display":"df-zfc-topo11-connected-subspace — ZFC Topo11 Connected Subspace","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-topo11-connected-subspace","aliases":["58-df-zfc-topo11-connected-subspace"],"display":"df-zfc-topo11-connected-subspace — ZFC Topo11 Connected Subspace","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-top2-connected-space.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-zfc-top2-subspace-topology.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-topo11-connected-subspace"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-topo11-connected-subspace</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-topo11-connected-subspace — ZFC Topo11 Connected Subspace"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c347796153b0ec02\" href=\"?note=c347796153b0ec02\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-zfc-top2-connected-space.md\">../batch01/58-df-zfc-top2-connected-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"694a41b0cb75249b\" href=\"?note=694a41b0cb75249b\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-zfc-top2-subspace-topology.md\">../batch12/58-df-zfc-top2-subspace-topology.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C,X,\\tau,\\tau_C\\in V\">\\(C,X,\\tau,\\tau_C\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop2SubspaceTopology}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ConnectedSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop2SubspaceTopology}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ConnectedSpace}_S\\)</span> (predicates from dependencies)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo11ConnectedSubspace}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopo11ConnectedSubspace}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo11\\text{-}connected\\text{-}subspace}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopo11ConnectedSubspace}_S(C,X,\\tau)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\tau_C\\;\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop2SubspaceTopology}_S(\\tau_C,C,X,\\tau)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ConnectedSpace}_S(C,\\tau_C)\n\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo11\\text{-}connected\\text{-}subspace}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopo11ConnectedSubspace}_S(C,X,\\tau)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\tau_C\\;\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop2SubspaceTopology}_S(\\tau_C,C,X,\\tau)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ConnectedSpace}_S(C,\\tau_C)\n\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The induced topology is produced explicitly and then passed to the\ncanonical connected-space predicate.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-zfc-top2-connected-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"c347796153b0ec02","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数